  "supersession_reason": "RUN 63, THE FOUR CHARTS. The owner looked at the live site and named four charts as broken. TWO of the production-tree members moved -- assets/js/detail.js and assets/js/neural_flow.js -- and TWO files were ADDED under server/tools, drive_run63_four_charts.py and test_run63_four_charts.py, which is why the suite population this freeze measures moves from 204 to 205. NEITHER moved file is SEQUENCE-BEARING, MEASURED against SEQUENCE_BEARING_FILES_FROM_V21 and not assumed, so this link declares V25_TO_V26_SEQUENCE_EXCEPTION as the EMPTY TUPLE rather than omitting an exception record. WHAT WAS FIXED, and both were REPRODUCED and then MEASURED in real Chromium against a fixture built to PRJ-001's shape. FIRST: the Signal Flow reported '0 uploaded documents across 0 types' on a page listing 100 documents, because it counted `signals_extracted` events since the last `signals_reset`. That window is permanently zero for a project that was reset and then recomputed: `w_resetsignals` supersedes every live row and deletes no document, and `projectcompute` re-reads the retained documents without appending one new extraction event. It now calls LinDetail.uploadedDocEvents -- the Documents panel's own reader, exported so there is ONE implementation -- gated on a LIVE stored row for the period the page holds, which is a STRONGER form of Run 18's cleared-project requirement because a reset supersedes every live row. SECOND: the Signal Flow recomputed a category status in the browser as the worst of its module statuses whenever the stored row carried none, and a category is fused from its VOTING modules only, so a non-voting result announced a category the row does not have -- 'two estimable categories' against the Project Signal Network's 'one Amber, ten No-data' over the same row. The fallback is removed and nothing replaces it. THIRD: detail.js grafts the served `source_documents` record onto the stored result; the Run 63 driver measured it arriving as null in the browser against a stored row holding seventeen. NO CONTROL was added, moved or removed. NO SERVER COMPUTATION MOVED: 101 registered, 63 in service, voting exactly A1.7 and A1.8, no stored figure changed, and the behaviour digest is RE-DERIVED and unchanged. THE AUTHORITY TREE DID NOT MOVE: its manifest sha256 b52c47a68a20ab1629681ea240abdea2167c67f289d181f446a8170704dc1596 is unmoved for a SEVENTH run. The v40 candidate, its identity, its gate and its release records are preserved unchanged as the historical evidence for anything computed under v40.",
